            "block_content": "\\begin{aligned}\\delta=&\\left[\\left(\\delta_{x}^{2}+\\delta_{y}^{2}\\right)\\right]^{1/2}\\\\\\delta_{y}=&\\frac{5w\\cos\\phi L^{4}}{384EI_{x}}\\\\\\delta_{x}=&\\frac{5w\\sin\\phi L^{4}}{384EI_{y}}\\\\w=&\\mathrm{e}_{\\mathrm{equiv}}\\mathrm{int}_{\\mathrm{int}}\\mathrm{static}\\mathrm{load}+\\mathrm{head}\\mathrm{load}\\\\=&2.92+\\frac{(4.8\\times4.5)+38}{1000}\\mathrm{kps}/\\mathrm{ft}=2.94\\mathrm{kps}/\\mathrm{ft}\\\\\\delta=&\\left[\\frac{\\left(5w\\sin\\phi L^{4}\\right)^{2}}{384EI_{y}}+\\frac{\\left(5w\\cos\\phi L^{4}\\right)^{2}}{384EI_{x}}\\right]^{1/2}\\\\=&\\frac{5w L^{4}}{38400E}\\times\\left[0.652^{2}+0.256^{2}\\right]^{1/2}=2.08\\mathrm{mech}\\end{aligned}",
